  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Pain Killer — Innate Technique (18th level)</em></p><p><em>Domain Expansion (rules): full-turn action, 20 CE unless stated, 175-ft radius, 1 minute. When the domain ends you suffer <strong>Technique Burnout</strong> (applied automatically by the module).</em></p><p>Finally at 18th level you have learned to expand your domain. At initiative 20, you and all creatures of your choice fall under the effects of <em>Pain Killer</em>. You can use <em>Analgesic</em> as a free action for no cursed energy without a reaction, but only once per damage instance.</p>",
